HANGA-AKAZI

A youth employment and opportunity discovery platform for Rwanda.

HANGA-AKAZI aims to help young people discover jobs, internships, training programmes, and entrepreneurship opportunities through a mobile-friendly platform.

Live Prototype

"Open HANGA-AKAZI" (https://jeanclaudendayishimiye478-ux.github.io/Hanga-kazi/)

Project Documentation

See ""PROJECT_DOCUMENTATION.md"" (PROJECT_DOCUMENTATION.md) for the project overview, development roadmap, testing checklist, collaboration plan, and limitations.

Main Goals

- Improve access to opportunity information.
- Link users to trusted sources.
- Use NISR labour-market data responsibly.
- Help users discover relevant opportunities.

Technology

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- GitHub Pages

Important Notice

This is a prototype. Demonstration opportunities are not confirmed vacancies. Statistics and opportunity announcements must be checked against their original sources.

Current Limitations

The prototype uses browser-based storage for some user data. This does not provide a shared database across all users.

Contribution

Collaborators should document changes, test the website, and verify data sources before publishing updates.